//
// Host-only gate for the W4 decode driver seams (no device, no downloads):
// flag -> artifact set, the narrow toolchain-gated sibling carry, the qwen
// 1e-6 RMS eps in the int4 FFN IR, and llama default-IR neutrality under the
// builder's new kwargs. Review of #33 (P0 eps regression gate + P2 tests).
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_w4_decode_driver.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: PASS  test_llama_default_ir_is_neutral_under_new_params
// CHECK: PASS  test_qwen_int4_ffn_carries_the_model_eps
// CHECK: PASS  test_selected_artifact_set_follows_the_flag
// CHECK: PASS  test_sibling_carry_is_narrow_and_toolchain_gated
// CHECK: w4_decode_driver tests: 4/4 passed
